Stage 1: setup candidate detector + 23 tests

replay-engine/src/replay_engine/stage1/candidate_detector.py

Per pipeline spec section 3:
- 5 candidate types: pullback, regime_establishment,
  macro_break_retest, failed_bounce, random
- 7 strata: trending, chop, opening_drive, midday, power_hour,
  overnight, post_fomc (priority order: post_fomc beats session,
  session beats regime-derived)
- detect_candidates_at(full_df, t_now) - pure function, materializes
  frame_df ONCE then runs all rules, never exposes full_df past the
  boundary (per Agent 35 section 3 discipline)
- compute_atr - 14-period default, returns None below period
- add_random_samples - emits diversity baseline every N bars

tests/test_candidate_detector.py - 23 tests covering:
- Constants completeness (CANDIDATE_TYPES, STRATA)
- ATR underflow + correctness
- Stratum priority order (post_fomc, session-of-day, regime)
- Pullback detection: fires when close near cloud + macro slope,
  not when far from clouds, returns False on short data
- Regime establishment fires when clouds align after divergence
- Macro break+retest fires on sign-flip, not on stable price
- Failed bounce fires on bear signature, returns False on short data
- End-to-end detector returns empty on warmup underflow
- Random samples emit at intervals, empty on short data

Audit clean. 92/92 pytest pass total (69 scoring + 23 detector).
54/54 vitest still pass.

Stage 1 RUN remains halted until user confirms Databento OHLCV-1s
historical tier covers the backtest window. Code is ready to consume
that data shape when entitlement confirmed.
